 huge new predator  in the oceans there'd barely be any fish  left for us  and not because their boats wouldn't  catch anything but because they would  and then megalodons would hunt them down  attack and eat everything in sight  it's not clear why megalodons  disappeared these millions of years ago  but it could be because the oceans got  too cold for them well now they'd be in  for a treat because our oceans are  warming up  thanks climate change  megalodons would Thrive and reproduce  you see more and more of these Predators  showing up  they'd be disrupting our shipping  operations and potentially bringing an  end to the cruise industry  but eventually they might die out once  again after they ate whatever they could  in the ocean and had nothing more to  feed on  or maybe the rise in global temperatures  would hurt us so much that we'd be the  ones to go extinct  but that's a story for another what if

